          "id": "prt_msg_ses_35_01_01",
          "sessionID": "ses_35",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_35_01",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi! I'm working on the \"mark topic as unread\" feature for our sprint and I drafted the user story for it, could you take a look and tell me if it's solid before I bring it to standup? Here's what I have: \"As a developer, I will add a boolean `unread` column to the topics table, write a `markTopicUnread(topicId, userId)` method in the topics controller, add a new `PUT /api/v1/topics/:id/unread` route that calls it, and update the topic list component to render an unread badge when the flag is true.\" I tried to be as specific as possible so whoever picks it up knows exactly what to build."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "id": "msg_ses_35_02",
        "sessionID": "ses_35",
        "role": "assistant",
        "time": {
          "created": 1759320004000,
