      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "prt_msg_ses_35_05_01",
          "sessionID": "ses_35",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_35_05",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ohh, okay, that actually makes a lot more sense when you put it that way — so the acceptance criteria can describe behavior pretty specifically, it's really just the *how* (the column, the function, the route) that shouldn't be baked into the story itself. I'll rewrite it as \"As a forum member, I want to mark a topic as unread so I can revisit it later\" with acceptance criteria underneath for the badge and persistence behavior."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
