          "id": "prt_msg_ses_35_07_01",
          "sessionID": "ses_35",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_35_07",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Great, thank you! Switching gears to testing this feature — I'm writing what I'm calling an integration test for the unread API route, and to keep it fully isolated I'm mocking the database layer, the session service, the response cache, and the socket.io emitter, so nothing outside the route handler itself actually runs. Does that sound like a solid integration test to you?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "id": "msg_ses_35_08",
        "sessionID": "ses_35",
        "role": "assistant",
        "time": {
          "created": 1759320017800,
